  {
    "id": "tg_works_guide",
    "trigger": "interact",
    "actions": [
      {
        "kind": "if",
        "cond": {
          "kind": "not",
          "of": {
            "kind": "flag",
            "flag": "tg_works_hint"
          }
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "kind": "setFlag",
            "flag": "tg_works_hint"
          },
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "TANK HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Three rules and then I'll leave you alone.",
              "Dark water will not have you. Do not stand there arguing with it."
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "TANK HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Pale water is the race, and the race is already going somewhere.",
              "Step in and you are going too. There is no swimming against it and no shame in that."
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "TANK HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Third: wherever it puts you, it meant to.",
              "So do not stand there feeling stupid. Stand there and look around."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "if",
        "cond": {
          "kind": "var",
          "var": "tg_gate",
          "op": ">=",
          "value": 1
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "TANK HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Hear that? North sluice is up. Whole tank's pulling for the gate.",
              "The race goes straight through to the sill now. Same water. Different mind."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "TANK HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Race is running east this month, into the dead end. It has to go somewhere.",
              "It will run east until somebody down there puts the beam over."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "tg_winch",
    "_note": "The gate-hand IS the winch. Her NPC carries both `trainer` and `script`: the first interaction is her battle, and once she is beaten the interact falls through to this script -- which is why trainer tg_hand_c deliberately has no `afterward` line, because an afterward would answer the interact and this would never run.",
    "trigger": "interact",
    "actions": [
      {
        "kind": "if",
        "cond": {
          "kind": "var",
          "var": "tg_gate",
          "op": ">=",
          "value": 1
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "GATE HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Beam's over. It stays over until the tide turns, and the tide does not turn for me.",
              "Go and get in the water. It is not the same water it was."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "GATE HAND",
            "lines": [
              "Right. You want the north sluice up.",
              "You could not have wanted it before now, because you could not have got here to ask."
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "ask",
            "lines": [
              "There is one beam and three sockets. North goes up, east comes down.",
              "That is not a design fault, that is what a sluice is. Shall I put it over?"
            ],
            "yes": [
              {
                "kind": "sfx",
                "sound": "fx_heavy"
              },
              {
                "kind": "shake",
                "frames": 30,
                "power": 3
              },
              {
                "kind": "setVar",
                "var": "tg_gate",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "lines": [
                  "The beam goes over with a noise like a door shutting underneath the floor.",
                  "The east end of the race dies in about four seconds. The tank leans north instead."
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "who": "GATE HAND",
                "lines": [
                  "That's you shut in here with me, by the way. Only way out of this staithe is the drain,",
                  "or the race - and the race is going somewhere new. Your choice which."
                ]
              }
            ],
            "no": [
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "who": "GATE HAND",
                "lines": [
                  "Suit yourself. I am here all week and so is the water.",
                  "Drain's in the corner if you want the steps."
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "tg_keeper",
    "trigger": "interact",
    "actions": [
      {
        "kind": "if",
        "cond": {
          "kind": "hasCrest",
          "crest": 3
        },
        "then": [
          {
            "kind": "say",
            "who": "MARIT VANE",
            "lines": [
              "Still dripping on my sill. Good. The stair is behind me and it only goes up.",
              "Watch the water in this city on your way out. It has been far too well behaved."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "else": [
          {
            "kind": "if",
            "cond": {
              "kind": "not",
              "of": {
                "kind": "hasCrest",
                "crest": 2
              }
            },
            "then": [
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "who": "MARIT VANE",
                "lines": [
                  "Two Crests before this one. That is not me being grand.",
                  "That is me not wanting to fish anybody out of my own tank. Go on. Come back wet."
                ]
              }
            ],
            "else": [
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "who": "MARIT VANE",
                "lines": [
                  "You came up the race. Everybody does.",
                  "There is no other way onto this sill, and that was built on purpose."
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "who": "MARIT VANE",
                "lines": [
                  "Marit Vane. I keep the gates that keep thirty thousand people dry.",
                  "The Hall is how I find out, every single day, whether the gates still answer."
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "say",
                "who": "MARIT VANE",
                "lines": [
                  "This city likes to talk about beating the sea. Thirty years, and I have never beaten it once.",
                  "I have been early. That is the whole trick, and there is not a second one."
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "battleTrainer",
                "trainer": "tg_keeper_vane"
              },
              {
                "kind": "if",
                "cond": {
                  "kind": "var",
                  "var": "last_battle_won",
                  "op": "==",
                  "value": 1
                },
                "then": [
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "Hold on."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "move",
                    "who": "tg_keeper",
                    "steps": [
                      "left",
                      "left",
                      "left"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "face",
                    "who": "tg_keeper",
                    "dir": "up"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "wait",
                    "frames": 45
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "lines": [
                      "She reads the gauge for a long moment, from about eight inches away.",
                      "Then she taps the glass once, the way you tap a glass you do not really doubt."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "move",
                    "who": "tg_keeper",
                    "steps": [
                      "right",
                      "right",
                      "right"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "face",
                    "who": "tg_keeper",
                    "dir": "down"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "No. Needle is where I left it. So that was me and not the tank.",
                      "Thirty years and it has been the tank twice. I like to know which."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "giveCrest",
                    "crest": 3,
                    "name": "Tide Crest"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "sfx",
                    "sound": "badge"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "lines": [
                      "You received the TIDE CREST.",
                      "Three of eight."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "giveArt",
                    "art": "wade"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "lines": [
                      "You learned the field art WADE.",
                      "Shallow water out in the world can be crossed now."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "Everything you did downstairs, you did by choosing which water to get into.",
                      "You never once pushed any of it. You cannot. Nobody can."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "That is my job and it is going to be a good deal of yours.",
                      "You do not move water. You decide where you are standing when it arrives."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "giveItem",
                    "item": "full_restore",
                    "count": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "lines": [
                      "Marit handed over a Full Restore."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "wait",
                    "frames": 20
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "One more thing, {name}, and I would rather you heard it from a sour old woman first.",
                      "There is a man in this city this week telling us he can stop storms."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "He is polite, he is clever, and his numbers are better than mine. I have checked.",
                      "I would very much like him to be right."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "say",
                    "who": "MARIT VANE",
                    "lines": [
                      "So go and listen to him. Properly, not the way you listen to somebody you have decided about.",
                      "Then ask him what he intends to do the first time the sea says no."
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "setFlag",
                    "flag": "crest_3_taken"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
